# Kbuild artifacts from building the out-of-tree modules in place (usbio-patch/,
# and dkms/* when built outside DKMS). Regenerated by every `make`, so without
# this they re-stage themselves on any `git add -A` -- which is how 15 of them
# reached the index on 2026-08-14.
*.o
*.ko
*.ko.zst
*.mod
*.mod.c
*.mod.o
.*.cmd
Module.symvers
modules.order
.tmp_versions/

# Byte-compiled howdy recorder sources (importing ir_reader.py writes these).
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# IDE artifacts
.idea/

